WEBVTT

00:05:58.320 --> 00:06:00.456
(Kicheko)

00:06:00.480 --> 00:06:03.176
Unataka kuniambia,
watu wamefanya kazi maisha yao yote,

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:05.776
wakinunua magari, nguo, nyumba
na vitu mbalimbali

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:08.016
lakini walikuwa waliishi hundi kwa hundi?

00:06:08.040 --> 00:06:12.376
Ni namna gani duniani wanajamii 
wangekwenda kuwasaidia wafungwa

00:06:12.400 --> 00:06:13.616
kurudi kwenye jamii

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:15.830
ikiwa hawakuweza kusimamia 
mambo yao wenyewe?

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:17.416
Tumevurugwa.

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:19.176
(Kicheko)

00:06:19.200 --> 00:06:20.600
Nahitaji mpango mzuri zaidi.

00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:24.640
Hii haitakwenda kufanya kazi vizuri.

00:06:25.040 --> 00:06:26.240
Hivyo ...

00:06:27.880 --> 00:06:29.080
Nilifikiria.